## the CHANGELOG's citation check and form (ruling 3; specs/0031 "The CHANGELOG (P1)", M4 part 2 P1's run log's checks carried; change NTB)
command: sha256sum <scripts>/changelog_check.py: 734080bc527a315e3024c608b086788f3394e7204c668e7eff234f3b744babe2; git show <phase commit>:records/logs/m4p2-p1/run.log, its line for the same file: 734080bc527a315e3024c608b086788f3394e7204c668e7eff234f3b744babe2 (1 lines)
